{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33925","headline":"江南道中怀茅山广文南阳博士三首 一 · 皮日休","name":"江南道中怀茅山广文南阳博士三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒岚依约认华阳，遥想高人卧草堂。\n半日始斋青䭀饭，移时空印白檀香。\n鹤雏入夜归云屋，乳管逢春落石牀。\n谁道夫君无伴侣，不离窗下见羲皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}